WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open Account Configuration and scroll to Zenodo Keys.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Add a sandbox-only key through the hidden password field.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Confirm the UI stores and displays only a masked token preview.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Review the active Sandbox key and safe advisory validation report.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The recording avoids any real token, production credential, or private account data.
